      "trip_type": null,
      "title": null,
      "text": "Great stop before heading into your tour! There are two kiosks to order and a friendly woman helping at another register. Your number is called and food is brought out on a tray.\n\nWe enjoyed our delicious food with a view. Our family of 4 got the chili, grilled cheese, PBJ, berry salad, corn cucumber salad and everything was wonderful! Even our picky eater finished. Don't forgot to try the cinnamon rolls!\n\nFor being open a few months they seem to have it figured out! Thank you!",
