      "author": "C J",
      "author_location": null,
      "trip_type": null,
      "title": null,
      "text": "Okay, so—this cafe needs some fine tuning. We visited today, on a Monday between meal times and it was a logistical nightmare. The line cuts in front of the access to the bathroom, the gals taking orders seemed deeply overwhelmed, some of the orders were being called out by number from the counter, some were being served by food runners. Someone needs to shuffle the whole cafe around, have a more efficient line situation, and hire more hands for the kitchen and coffee area. I think the food has EXCELLENT potential, we only had coffee and a cookie (which was very good!) but the logistics and serving situation need to be fine tuned. I hope they get some of the details ironed out before we visit again. Lots and lots of potential, but have patience if you visit anytime soon!",
